# Credential values for this agent. Copy to `.env` and fill in.
#
#   cp credentials/.env.example credentials/.env
#
# `.env` is git-ignored and never copied to the cloud. Never print these values,
# never paste them into a chat, never commit them.
#
# Variable names follow the slot's `env_prefix` in cinna-agent.json plus the field
# name in upper case. Declare the slot there first, then add its variables here.
#
# Example for an `email_imap` slot named "billing-inbox" with
# env_prefix "BILLING_INBOX_":
#
# BILLING_INBOX_HOST=imap.example.org
# BILLING_INBOX_PORT=993
# BILLING_INBOX_LOGIN=billing@example.org
# BILLING_INBOX_PASSWORD=
# BILLING_INBOX_IS_SSL=true
